      "repair_reason": "- [P2] A maintainer must confirm whether the helper’s deliberate symlink rejection is compatible with the supported extension-path contract before the otherwise focused patch lands.; Cleared: The two-file diff uses an existing internal safe-file wrapper and adds no dependency, workflow, permission, secret, or supply-chain surface. (sha=7b693a454c9a0d0160427ac392289f53e22f49a1)",
      "review_summary": "The branch replaces the unbounded extension-source `readFileSync` scan with a 10 MiB `readRegularFileSync` cap and adds a valid oversized-JavaScript fallback-to-Jiti regression test.\n\nPR surface: Source +9, Tests +30. Total +39 across 2 files.\n\nReproducibility: no. high-confidence reproduction of the original unbounded-memory failure was run in this review; source inspection and the supplied 11 MiB after-fix exercise make the affected routing path reproducible from source.",
